  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Roughly chop tomato.\n• Grate carrot.\n• Finely chop garlic and red onion.\n• Drain and rinse black beans.\n• In a small microwave-safe bowl, combine half the onion, a drizzle of vinegar and a good pinch of sugar and salt.\n• Microwave onion for 30 second bursts, until softened.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f87b5ecade9b9f0acf61ae/step-13330d00.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Crush tomato and pickled onion in a mortar and pestle and pound until your preferred consistency.\n• Add the brown sugar, a drizzle of olive oil and a pinch of salt and pepper and stir to combine. TIP: Add a drizzle more vinegar, if this is to your taste!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f87b5ecade9b9f0acf61ae/step-9aac4510.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook plant-based mince, beans and remaining onion until tender and the liquid is evaporated, breaking up with a spoon, until just browned, 4-5 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f87b5ecade9b9f0acf61ae/step-2cc7d620.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add the butter, garlic and Tex-Mex spice blend (see ingredients) and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Remove from heat then lightly crush beans with a fork. Stir through mild chipotle sauce. Cover to keep warm.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f87b5ecade9b9f0acf61ae/step-b0174b30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, in a large bowl, combine mixed salad leaves, carrot and a drizzle of olive oil. Season.\n• Microwave mini flour tortillas on a plate in 10 second bursts until warmed through.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f87b5ecade9b9f0acf61ae/step-3e594140.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Fill tacos with salad, plant-based mince and refried black beans.\n• Top with crushed tomato salsa and light sour cream to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f87b5ecade9b9f0acf61ae/step-d6057050.jpg"
    }
  ]
